%% SWD_Program - main state machine (matches SWD_Program.ino / stm32_flash.cpp)
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> BOOT
    BOOT: BOOT<br/>IO init (ERROR/BUSY/PASS = LOW)<br/>SWD lines high-Z, display init

    BOOT --> IDLE
    IDLE: IDLE / READY<br/>show SD status + .bin per folder<br/>rescan SD every 3 s (until first job)
    IDLE --> IDLE: 3 s timer / rescan SD

    IDLE --> JOB: START falling edge (debounced 30 ms)<br/>ERROR=LOW, PASS=LOW, BUSY=HIGH
    PASS --> JOB: START
    FAIL --> JOB: START

    state JOB {
        direction TB
        [*] --> SD_INIT
        SD_INIT: SD_INIT<br/>mount FAT32 (SdFat, SPI1)
        SD_INIT --> CONNECT: card OK

        CONNECT: CONNECT<br/>line reset, JTAG→SWD, read DPIDR<br/>debug power-up
        CONNECT --> CONNECT_RST: no response and NRST wired
        CONNECT_RST: CONNECT_UNDER_RESET<br/>NRST=LOW, retry SWD
        CONNECT --> HALT: DPIDR OK
        CONNECT_RST --> HALT: DPIDR OK

        HALT: HALT<br/>C_HALT + VC_CORERESET<br/>system reset → halt at reset vector
        HALT --> IDENTIFY: S_HALT set

        IDENTIFY: IDENTIFY<br/>CPUID + DBGMCU IDCODE<br/>0x413 → F405 · 0x460 → G071<br/>read flash size, check RDP
        IDENTIFY --> SELECT_FILE: supported, RDP level 0

        SELECT_FILE: SELECT_FILE<br/>exactly one .bin in /F405 or /G071
        SELECT_FILE --> CHECK_IMAGE: file found

        CHECK_IMAGE: CHECK_IMAGE<br/>size ≤ flash, vector table valid
        CHECK_IMAGE --> ERASE: image OK

        ERASE: ERASE (1/3)<br/>F4 sectors / G0 2 KB pages<br/>progress bar
        ERASE --> PROGRAM: done

        PROGRAM: PROGRAM (2/3)<br/>4 KB chunks from SD<br/>F4 32-bit · G0 64-bit
        PROGRAM --> VERIFY: done (VERIFY_AFTER_PROGRAM=1)

        VERIFY: VERIFY (3/3)<br/>read back and compare
        VERIFY --> [*]: match
    }

    JOB --> PASS: success<br/>lock flash, reset & run target
    JOB --> FAIL: any error in any state<br/>lock flash, release SWD

    PASS: PASS<br/>BUSY=LOW, PASS=HIGH<br/>green banner + time
    FAIL: ERROR<br/>BUSY=LOW, ERROR=HIGH (latched)<br/>red banner + error text
